                            <comment id="16241533" author="githubbot" created="Tue, 7 Nov 2017 05:56:52 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user akuramshingg opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/2984&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/2984&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6700&quot; title=&quot;Node considered as failed can cause failure of others nodes&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-6700&quot;&gt;IGNITE-6700&lt;/a&gt; Node considered as failed can cause failure of others nodes&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Independent asynchronous connection checkers for the previous and the next nodes.&lt;br/&gt;
