    Remember the list of recently failed server nodes.&lt;br/&gt;
    Synchronized access to sendMessageAcrossRing().&lt;br/&gt;
    Local node freeze detection.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    New TcpDiscoverySplitTest based on IgniteCacheTopologySplitAbstractTest.&lt;br/&gt;
    CacheLateAffinityAssignmentTest and TcpDiscoverySelfTest update.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    GridDhtPartitionTopologyImpl update: &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6433&quot; title=&quot;We need to handle possible eviction when we should own a partition because we had lost it&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-6433&quot;&gt;IGNITE-6433&lt;/a&gt; workaround.&lt;/p&gt;

